implementationPlan.description:
VERIFY: the one gate, and this docs fix's regression test. From the task worktree root, run executionContract checkRefs[0] exactly as written. It prints dod1/dod2/dod3/wt/files and exits 0 only when all of these hold:
- the DoD 1 grep counts 0;
- every install-all.ps1 line carries -InstallPlugin (DoD 2);
- the phrase 'only ever runs against the project root' is gone even across a line wrap. Lines are joined first, because the raw DoD 3 grep already printed 0 at HEAD, the phrase being split over :667-668;
- both .worktrees passages (the OWNED_PATH_MISSING bullet, and item '4. The edits were made') mention 'worktree mode';
- `git diff --name-only` against the merge base with moe/work-2026-10-24 lists only docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md (DoD 3).
Baseline at c99801aa: dod1=5 dod2=1 dod3=1 wt=0,0, exit 1. Error handling for a red run:
- a nonzero count: re-open the named passage and fix the text, never the gate;
- an extra path in files=: revert that path. Docs-only row: no other file may change, and no .moe/ path can appear in the sparse worktree.
QA in the control checkout: run the same command minus the diff check (board diffs are uncommitted there), then `git show --name-only --format= <completion sha>`, which must list only docs/TROUBLESHOOTING.md. Submit the command, exitCode and outputTail via moe.complete_task.
